    <string name="about_description">RepLog is an intelligent gym training tracker that helps you log workouts, track progression, detect plateaus, and compete with friends based on relative improvement.</string>

    <!-- Help / FAQ -->
    <string name="faq">Frequently Asked Questions</string>
    <string name="contact_support">Contact Support</string>
    <string name="faq_q1">How do I log a workout?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">Tap the \"Start Workout\" button on the Home screen. Add exercises from the library, enter your sets with reps and weight, then tap \"Finish\" to save.</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">What is the Delta Leaderboard?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">The Delta Leaderboard ranks you and your friends by percentage improvement in total training volume over the last 4 weeks. This makes competition fair regardless of experience level.</string>
    <string name="faq_q3">What does the plateau indicator mean?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">A plateau badge (⚠️) appears when your max weight on an exercise hasn\'t changed for 2 or more weeks. The app will suggest strategies to break through.</string>
    <string name="faq_q4">What is RepLog PRO?</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">PRO (€1/month) unlocks the AI Coach for personalized training plans, full analytics, complete friend history, direct challenges, and global leaderboards.</string>
    <string name="faq_q5">How does the AI Coach work?</string>
    <string name="faq_a5">The AI Coach analyzes your last 4 weeks of training data using a language model. It identifies patterns, stagnation, and recovery indicators, then provides a tailored weekly plan with specific load and rep targets.</string>
